  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust (LSETF)- LoftyInc Digital Literacy Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loftyinc Allied partners Limited is proposing to deliver digital skills training unemployed Lagos state residents by leveraging her partners across the various spectrum of services required to deliver the program outcome . The company plans to use its strategic partnerships with Microsoft, VMWare and IBM to deliver digital skills training in the following areas: Cloud computing, virtualization, cybersecurity, robotics, coding and blockchain technology. Loftyinc Allied Partners Limited intends to adopt a three-pronged approach for all beneficiaries: Training, job placement and entrepreneurship support. The company plans to have the training in steams. Three streams per year; Fifty students per stream; twelve weeks per stream.</narrative>
  </description>
